1
00:00:10,343 --> 00:00:13,722
SERIAL NETFLIX ORIGINAL

2
00:00:35,744 --> 00:00:36,661
Apa yang terjadi?

3
00:00:37,245 --> 00:00:40,874
- Kondisinya mendadak memburuk.
- Sebelumnya, pernah begini juga?

4
00:00:40,957 --> 00:00:44,044
Ini kadang terjadi
saat fungsi tubuhnya menurun.

5
00:00:44,127 --> 00:00:47,922
Namun, kali ini, jauh lebih buruk.

6
00:00:48,757 --> 00:00:49,591
Apa…

7
00:00:50,091 --> 00:00:52,218
maksudmu dengan jauh lebih buruk?

8
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:54,846
Mungkin perlu dioperasi.

9
00:00:54,929 --> 00:00:57,849
Jika dibutuhkan, segera lakukan
Apa yang kau tunggu?

10
00:00:57,932 --> 00:01:00,643
- Sang-gu.
- Apa karena biaya operasi?

11
00:01:01,311 --> 00:01:02,812
Biar aku yang urus.

12
00:01:07,317 --> 00:01:09,694
Kondisi pasien belum stabil.

13
00:01:09,778 --> 00:01:12,572
Dalam situasi ini,
aku tak menyarankan dioperasi.

14
00:01:12,655 --> 00:01:15,950
Jika tak dioperasi,
apa yang akan terjadi?

15
00:01:17,744 --> 00:01:19,621
Kau harus bersiap melepas kepergiannya.

16
00:01:22,248 --> 00:01:23,249
Sialan!

17
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:32,884
Dia akan dioperasi.

18
00:01:33,468 --> 00:01:35,470
- Ayolah, Sang-gu.
- Tolong lakukan.

19
00:01:36,054 --> 00:01:38,348
Katamu dia akan mati jika tak dioperasi.

20
00:01:38,431 --> 00:01:40,725
Dia harus dioperasi untuk bertahan hidup.

21
00:01:41,309 --> 00:01:43,103
Jika wali pasien sudah memutuskan,

22
00:01:43,186 --> 00:01:46,189
kami tak punya pilihan
selain melakukan yang kau inginkan.

23
00:01:46,689 --> 00:01:49,943
Coba diskusikan lagi dan beri tahu kami.

24
00:01:57,158 --> 00:01:58,118
Mari berhenti.

25
00:01:59,911 --> 00:02:00,745
Tak boleh.

26
00:02:01,246 --> 00:02:05,208
Berapa lama lagi kami harus menderita
supaya kau bisa merasa tenang?

27
00:02:06,459 --> 00:02:08,128
Kau sudah melihatnya.

28
00:02:08,753 --> 00:02:11,548
Kau tak bisa menyebutnya hidup!

29
00:02:12,382 --> 00:02:13,299
Dia masih hidup.

30
00:02:14,425 --> 00:02:16,052
Dia bertahan sampai saat ini.

31
00:02:16,136 --> 00:02:19,013
Dia masih bernapas
dan jantungnya berdetak.

32
00:02:20,598 --> 00:02:22,350
Dia bisa tetap hidup.

33
00:02:23,143 --> 00:02:24,352
Aku akan mewujudkannya.

34
00:02:25,979 --> 00:02:27,063
Sang-gu!

35
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,441
Aku akan menyiapkan…

36
00:02:31,818 --> 00:02:32,777
biaya operasi.

37
00:02:37,157 --> 00:02:38,241
Sang-gu!

38
00:03:26,748 --> 00:03:27,582
Sial.

39
00:03:38,593 --> 00:03:40,053
LISENSI BISNIS

40
00:03:49,437 --> 00:03:51,606
SERTIFIKAT PENDAFTARAN
KEPEMILIKAN PROPERTI

41
00:03:51,689 --> 00:03:53,399
ATAS NAMA: HAN JEONG-U
(HANEUL-DONG 246-2)

42
00:03:53,483 --> 00:03:55,026
INFORMASI PENDAFTARAN

43
00:04:06,246 --> 00:04:07,830
Anggaplah kau membayar utangmu.

44
00:04:21,511 --> 00:04:23,346
Kenapa dia berlari keluar selarut ini?

45
00:04:27,976 --> 00:04:30,979
Seperti pencuri yang sedang kabur.

46
00:04:38,194 --> 00:04:39,487
Di mana pamanmu?

47
00:04:40,071 --> 00:04:41,072
Dia pergi keluar.

48
00:04:48,371 --> 00:04:49,205
Geu-ru.

49
00:04:50,790 --> 00:04:52,417
Apa pendapatmu mengenai pamanmu?

50
00:04:54,419 --> 00:04:55,753
Pamanku…

51
00:04:57,171 --> 00:04:58,256
sangat jorok.

52
00:04:59,757 --> 00:05:05,471
Dia benci mandi, bersih-bersih,
mencuci pakaian, dan mencuci piring.

53
00:05:06,889 --> 00:05:11,102
Dia suka mengelap kotoran hidung
dan telinga ke pakaiannya.

54
00:05:11,185 --> 00:05:13,354
Dan pakaian itu dipakai selama seminggu.

55
00:05:14,022 --> 00:05:16,149
- Menjijikkan.
- Paman juga…

56
00:05:16,774 --> 00:05:18,276
sangat berisik.

57
00:05:19,027 --> 00:05:21,696
- Apa?
- Suaranya keras, dia sering berteriak,

58
00:05:21,779 --> 00:05:24,240
dan mendengkur sangat keras saat tidur.

59
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:27,452
Dia juga suka bersuara saat makan,

60
00:05:27,535 --> 00:05:30,955
bersendawa setelah makan, dan suara
kentutnya terdengar sampai kamarku.

61
00:05:31,039 --> 00:05:32,665
Bukan itu yang kutanyakan.

62
00:05:33,458 --> 00:05:36,169
Menurutmu, apa dia orang baik atau tidak.

63
00:05:36,836 --> 00:05:38,796
Apa kau membencinya? Atau takut kepadanya?

64
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:39,714
Oh.

65
00:05:42,258 --> 00:05:43,551
Kalau begitu, pamanku…

66
00:05:44,969 --> 00:05:46,721
orang baik yang bingung.

67
00:05:48,848 --> 00:05:49,682
Apa?

68
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:52,602
Paman selalu mengatakan hal buruk.

69
00:05:54,103 --> 00:05:54,937
"Hei, Bodoh."

70
00:05:55,688 --> 00:05:56,522
"Kau gila."

71
00:05:57,023 --> 00:05:59,901
"Jangan buat masalah.
Jangan lakukan hal tak berguna."

72
00:06:01,778 --> 00:06:03,404
Dia selalu marah kepadaku.

73
00:06:03,488 --> 00:06:05,782
Benar. Lantas kenapa
kau menyebutnya orang baik?

74
00:06:06,491 --> 00:06:07,325
Namun,

75
00:06:08,451 --> 00:06:11,204
dia selalu membantuku
melakukan semua yang kuinginkan.

76
00:06:12,622 --> 00:06:15,124
Dia menemukan kotak kuning
di tempat sampah.

77
00:06:15,208 --> 00:06:18,252
Dia pun menemukan kamera
di rumah Nona Lee Seon-yeong.

78
00:06:19,629 --> 00:06:23,966
Ayahku bilang orang yang terlihat galak,
tapi sebenarnya perhatian dan bijaksana

79
00:06:24,050 --> 00:06:25,593
adalah orang yang baik.

80
00:06:27,178 --> 00:06:30,473
Itu sebabnya pamanku 
adalah orang baik yang bingung.

81
00:06:50,201 --> 00:06:54,080
10 TAHUN LALU

82
00:07:01,379 --> 00:07:03,172
Sialan. Kemari kau!

83
00:07:04,006 --> 00:07:05,007
Dasar berengsek!

84
00:07:08,469 --> 00:07:09,929
Bajingan.

85
00:07:18,229 --> 00:07:19,355
Ayo!

86
00:07:33,161 --> 00:07:34,787
Tak perlu dihitung, 'kan?

87
00:07:44,755 --> 00:07:45,590
Hei.

88
00:07:50,761 --> 00:07:53,181
Hei, minggir. Giliranku.

89
00:07:53,264 --> 00:07:54,307
Bersiaplah.

90
00:07:57,143 --> 00:07:58,394
Astaga.

91
00:07:58,478 --> 00:07:59,604
Kemari kau.

92
00:07:59,687 --> 00:08:02,273
Angkat wajahmu. Tegakkan badanmu.

93
00:08:02,857 --> 00:08:04,108
Bersiaplah.

94
00:08:05,568 --> 00:08:06,986
Bangun kau, Berengsek.

95
00:08:08,196 --> 00:08:09,071
Hei.

96
00:08:10,531 --> 00:08:12,074
Jangan berdiri, Bodoh.

97
00:08:12,158 --> 00:08:12,992
Sial!

98
00:08:17,246 --> 00:08:19,207
Bersikaplah jika tak ingin dipukuli.

99
00:08:19,290 --> 00:08:20,541
Mau ke mana kau?

100
00:08:21,501 --> 00:08:22,585
Apa yang dia lakukan?

101
00:08:24,086 --> 00:08:25,213
Apa yang kau lakukan?

102
00:08:25,338 --> 00:08:26,380
Dia malah coba-coba.

103
00:08:26,964 --> 00:08:28,591
Aku lompat jika kalian mendekat.

104
00:08:28,674 --> 00:08:30,843
Silakan lompat, Banci.

105
00:08:30,927 --> 00:08:33,888
Aku akan jadi adikmu jika kau
berani melakukannya. Dasar keparat.

106
00:08:36,140 --> 00:08:37,016
Lompat.

107
00:08:37,099 --> 00:08:38,351
Dasar bodoh.

108
00:08:38,434 --> 00:08:40,102
Idiot itu tak akan berani melompat.

109
00:08:42,813 --> 00:08:43,773
Dia sungguh memanjat.

110
00:08:45,149 --> 00:08:46,025
Ayo.

111
00:08:46,108 --> 00:08:47,944
- Apa yang akan kau lakukan?
- Lompatlah.

112
00:08:50,571 --> 00:08:51,656
Kalian sedang apa?

113
00:08:54,283 --> 00:08:55,117
Apa?

114
00:08:56,661 --> 00:08:57,954
Siapa kau?

115
00:08:58,037 --> 00:09:00,623
Kenapa kau ikut campur?

116
00:09:00,706 --> 00:09:01,666
Kau kenal kami?

117
00:09:01,749 --> 00:09:03,125
Tentu saja tidak.

118
00:09:04,252 --> 00:09:05,795
Haruskah kita saling mengenal?

119
00:09:05,878 --> 00:09:08,756
Apa yang akan kau lakukan?
Melaporkan kami ke polisi?

120
00:09:09,674 --> 00:09:12,635
Jika kau berjanji tak mengganggunya lagi,

121
00:09:12,718 --> 00:09:14,053
aku akan pergi.

122
00:09:14,136 --> 00:09:16,055
Pria ini teler atau apa?

123
00:09:16,973 --> 00:09:18,766
Jangan banyak berlagak.

124
00:09:23,646 --> 00:09:24,605
Sialan!

125
00:09:25,356 --> 00:09:26,190
Sial!

126
00:09:27,858 --> 00:09:29,026
Aduh!

127
00:09:29,485 --> 00:09:30,319
Hei.

128
00:09:31,737 --> 00:09:32,905
Sialan!

129
00:09:35,366 --> 00:09:37,660
Jika kupelintir lagi, kau akan lumpuh.

130
00:09:37,743 --> 00:09:40,746
Aku tak masalah dipenjara beberapa bulan,

131
00:09:40,830 --> 00:09:43,666
tapi kau akan cacat seumur hidup.
Kau tak keberatan?

132
00:09:43,749 --> 00:09:45,418
Tolong lepaskan aku. Sial!

133
00:09:46,794 --> 00:09:50,339
Kau baru akan kapok setelah lumpuh total.

134
00:09:50,423 --> 00:09:51,674
- Diam.
- Tolong hentikan.

135
00:09:53,259 --> 00:09:54,093
"Tolong hentikan"?

136
00:09:54,594 --> 00:09:58,097
Bagaimana kau bisa bilang begitu
setelah mereka menghajarmu?

137
00:09:58,180 --> 00:10:00,141
Mereka tak akan melakukannya lagi.

138
00:10:01,726 --> 00:10:03,394
Jika ya, kau bisa memarahi mereka.

139
00:10:05,479 --> 00:10:06,647
Sial!

140
00:10:10,318 --> 00:10:11,193
Sial.

141
00:10:11,861 --> 00:10:12,903
Pergi kau, Bajingan.

142
00:10:21,829 --> 00:10:22,913
Terima kasih.

143
00:10:28,461 --> 00:10:30,212
Jangan salah paham.

144
00:10:30,296 --> 00:10:32,715
Aku lebih membenci pecundang
yang dipukuli sepertimu

145
00:10:32,798 --> 00:10:35,426
daripada para perundung yang memukulimu.

146
00:10:44,226 --> 00:10:46,687
TINJU

147
00:11:18,052 --> 00:11:19,011
Halo.

148
00:11:20,930 --> 00:11:21,931
Ini.

149
00:11:27,186 --> 00:11:29,855
Sudah kubilang,
jangan muncul di hadapanku.

150
00:11:29,939 --> 00:11:31,524
Pergilah.

151
00:11:31,607 --> 00:11:33,859
Berhenti menggangguku seperti ini!

152
00:11:34,902 --> 00:11:35,736
Sialan!

153
00:11:36,529 --> 00:11:39,031
Kenapa aku menyelamatkan
orang bodoh sepertimu?

154
00:11:39,115 --> 00:11:40,700
Sungguh merepotkan.

155
00:11:41,575 --> 00:11:42,993
Tanggung jawab.

156
00:11:44,704 --> 00:11:48,374
Aku tak pernah memintamu menyelamatkanku,
tapi kau tetap melakukannya.

157
00:11:50,126 --> 00:11:52,628
- Kau sudah gila?
- Karena kau sudah menyelamatkanku,

158
00:11:53,796 --> 00:11:54,964
kau harus tanggung jawab.

159
00:11:56,006 --> 00:11:59,093
Aku sudah seperti mati hari itu,
tapi kau menyelamatkanku.

160
00:12:00,678 --> 00:12:01,679
Tanggung jawab.

161
00:12:02,888 --> 00:12:06,475
Kenapa aku harus bertanggung jawab?
Apa kau gila?

162
00:12:06,559 --> 00:12:07,393
Hei, pergilah.

163
00:12:08,269 --> 00:12:09,353
Pergilah!

164
00:12:09,937 --> 00:12:12,148
Pergilah, Berengsek. Aku tak main-main.

165
00:12:17,570 --> 00:12:18,612
Cepat pergi dari sini!

166
00:12:19,572 --> 00:12:21,615
Bajingan itu sungguh gila. Astaga.

167
00:12:40,050 --> 00:12:41,761
Astaga, berandal ini lagi.

168
00:12:42,511 --> 00:12:43,929
Hei, pergilah.

169
00:12:44,472 --> 00:12:45,806
Pulanglah.

170
00:12:53,189 --> 00:12:55,608
Aku menyuruhmu pergi. 
Sudah kubilang, pulanglah.

171
00:13:08,078 --> 00:13:08,954
Pakai ini.

172
00:13:09,455 --> 00:13:10,289
Sungguh?

173
00:13:10,873 --> 00:13:12,666
Aku tak yakin muat.

174
00:13:14,585 --> 00:13:16,170
Pas sekali untukku.

175
00:13:17,546 --> 00:13:19,757
- Bagaimana?
- Karena lenganmu panjang,

176
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,884
- kau bisa jadi out-boxer.
- Out-boxer?

177
00:13:21,967 --> 00:13:24,261
Jaga jarakmu dengan lawan,

178
00:13:24,345 --> 00:13:26,263
dan kalahkan dengan satu pukulan.

179
00:13:26,347 --> 00:13:27,389
Satu pukulan.

180
00:13:33,145 --> 00:13:33,979
Seperti itu?

181
00:13:35,564 --> 00:13:39,193
Out-boxer memiliki lengan panjang,
tapi harus sangat cepat.

182
00:13:39,276 --> 00:13:40,110
Seperti ini.

183
00:13:41,362 --> 00:13:42,571
- Cobalah.
- Luar biasa.

184
00:13:47,743 --> 00:13:49,161
Angkat kedua tanganmu.

185
00:13:51,831 --> 00:13:53,499
Regangkan tanganmu dengan cepat.

186
00:13:54,375 --> 00:13:55,334
Bungkus.

187
00:13:56,210 --> 00:13:57,253
Bungkus dua kali.

188
00:13:58,712 --> 00:13:59,672
Setelah itu,

189
00:14:01,215 --> 00:14:03,175
letakkan di antara jarimu.

190
00:14:03,551 --> 00:14:05,052
Letakkan di antara jari.

191
00:14:05,594 --> 00:14:08,180
Lalu, antara ibu jari dan jari telunjuk.

192
00:14:08,764 --> 00:14:10,891
Sekarang, bungkus
pergelangan tanganmu sekali.

193
00:14:14,270 --> 00:14:16,188
- Satu, dua.
- Satu, dua.

194
00:14:16,272 --> 00:14:18,899
Tekuk lututmu sedikit lagi.

195
00:14:18,983 --> 00:14:21,569
Dan angkat kedua tanganmu.
Kau mengerti? Ulang lagi.

196
00:14:21,652 --> 00:14:23,028
- Satu, dua.
- Satu, dua.

197
00:14:23,112 --> 00:14:24,822
Ayo, sedikit lagi.

198
00:14:24,905 --> 00:14:27,908
Satu. Satu. Pukul. Satu, dua.

199
00:14:27,992 --> 00:14:30,828
- Satu, dua.
- Pukul. Pukul. Satu, dua.

200
00:14:30,911 --> 00:14:31,829
- Dua.
- Dua.

201
00:14:31,912 --> 00:14:34,582
Gunakan pinggulmu. Angkat kedua tanganmu.

202
00:14:34,665 --> 00:14:37,459
Tanganmu terlalu rendah.
Lakukan lagi. Pukul. Bagus.

203
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,503
Terus pukul sampai akhir!

204
00:14:39,587 --> 00:14:40,713
Satu, dua. Bagus!

205
00:14:44,466 --> 00:14:45,926
Jangan sentuh talinya.

206
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,386
Tekuk lututmu!

207
00:14:48,429 --> 00:14:49,263
Bagus!

208
00:14:49,346 --> 00:14:52,766
Satu, dua. Bagus!

209
00:14:52,850 --> 00:14:54,685
Ayo, sedikit lagi!

210
00:14:54,768 --> 00:14:56,812
Hei, belum selesai. Lebih cepat!

211
00:14:57,938 --> 00:14:58,772
Ayo!

212
00:14:58,856 --> 00:15:02,568
Bagus! Terus lakukan sampai akhir.

213
00:15:04,570 --> 00:15:07,865
Hei, Su-jin. Kenapa kau kemari?

214
00:15:09,491 --> 00:15:10,576
Ini adikku.

215
00:15:10,659 --> 00:15:11,493
- Oh.
- Halo.

216
00:15:12,786 --> 00:15:14,496
- Dan ini pelatihku.
- Rupanya begitu.

217
00:15:24,214 --> 00:15:25,257
Pukul!

218
00:15:25,341 --> 00:15:28,510
Satu, dua! Satu, dua! Bagus!

219
00:15:29,053 --> 00:15:30,471
Bagus!

220
00:15:30,554 --> 00:15:31,388
Pukul.

221
00:15:32,514 --> 00:15:34,725
Hati-hati, pukulan. Bagus. Menghindar.

222
00:15:35,935 --> 00:15:37,394
Kait. Bagus.

223
00:15:39,438 --> 00:15:40,356
Satu, dua!

224
00:15:40,439 --> 00:15:41,440
Satu, dua!

225
00:15:43,484 --> 00:15:45,694
Kau tak boleh berakhir sepertiku.

226
00:15:46,570 --> 00:15:50,532
Pelajari pendidikan jasmani di universitas
dan bertarunglah di kejuaraan!

227
00:15:51,575 --> 00:15:52,534
Kau pasti bisa.

228
00:15:53,035 --> 00:15:55,871
Tak sulit menjadi atlet nasional.
Satu, dua!

229
00:15:55,955 --> 00:15:57,039
Satu, dua!

230
00:16:01,043 --> 00:16:02,252
Jaga jarakmu.

231
00:16:02,336 --> 00:16:03,462
Bagus.

232
00:16:05,214 --> 00:16:06,632
Apa yang dia lakukan?

233
00:16:06,715 --> 00:16:07,800
Astaga, berandal itu.

234
00:16:08,258 --> 00:16:11,011
Jangan emosi, Su-cheol. Tenanglah.

235
00:16:11,553 --> 00:16:13,138
Bagus.

236
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:15,808
Masuklah. Bagus! Terus sudutkan dia!

237
00:16:15,891 --> 00:16:18,310
Bagus!

238
00:16:19,478 --> 00:16:21,563
Bagus! Kau menjatuhkan dia sekali. Baik.

239
00:16:22,982 --> 00:16:23,816
Ayo.

240
00:16:25,067 --> 00:16:27,736
Kita sudah bersusah payah
